<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Reply</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>reply &lt;number&gt;
</pre>
<p>At a board (or with one in your hands), reply writes an answer to message 
&lt;number&gt; on it. You get the editor as when you write a new message, and your 
answer is posted as a new message titled "re" and the title of the one you 
answered, so others can follow the thread.
</p><p>Like writing, replying to most boards needs level 10, and you can't reply when 
the board is full or the message is still being written.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Boards</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Read</a>
</pre>




</div>